{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":59,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician, Altaschith, Michtam of David; when Saul sent, and they watched the house to kill him. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 59:1"},"Deliver me from mine enemies, O my God: defend me from them that rise up against me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 59:2"},"Deliver me from the workers of iniquity, and save me from bloody men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 59:3"},"For, lo, they lie in wait for my soul: the mighty are gathered against me; not ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," my transgression, nor ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," my sin, O LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 59:4"},"They run and prepare themselves without ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["my"]}," fault: awake to help me, and behold. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 59:5"},"Thou therefore, O LORD God of hosts, the God of Israel, awake to visit all the heathen: be not merciful to any wicked transgressors. Selah. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 59:6"},"They return at evening: they make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 59:7"},"Behold, they belch out with their mouth: swords ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," in their lips: for who, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["say they,"]}," doth hear? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 59:8"},"But thou, O LORD, shalt laugh at them; thou shalt have all the heathen in derision. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 59:9"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Because of"]}," his strength will I wait upon thee: for God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," my defence. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 59:10"},"The God of my mercy shall prevent me: God shall let me see ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["my desire"]}," upon mine enemies. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 59:11"},"Slay them not, lest my people forget: scatter them by thy power; and bring them down, O Lord our shield. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 59:12"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["For"]}," the sin of their mouth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the words of their lips let them even be taken in their pride: and for cursing and lying ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," they speak. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 59:13"},"Consume ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them"]}," in wrath, consume ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them,"]}," that they ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["may"]}," not ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be:"]}," and let them know that God ruleth in Jacob unto the ends of the earth. Selah. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 59:14"},"And at evening let them return; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," let them make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 59:15"},"Let them wander up and down for meat, and grudge if they be not satisfied. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 59:16"},"But I will sing of thy power; yea, I will sing aloud of thy mercy in the morning: for thou hast been my defence and refuge in the day of my trouble. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 59:17"},"Unto thee, O my strength, will I sing: for God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," my defence, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the God of my mercy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 59:17"}]}]}
